<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Is that so. I believe that is a fine choice as well.<PG>
Should you change your mind, I will carry out the procedure to unlock the second arc through the same operation as before.<PG>
However, the deadline is the end of the first scenario. Please take care.<PG>
I am terribly sorry, but as I will close this world once, would you kindly launch it again?<PG>
Well then, if you will excuse me.<PG>
{MESOFF "-1"}
